  "prefLabel": "Pod 103.02 Duties of the Board",
  "priorExpiration": "1998-05-08",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pod 103.02 Duties of the Board. The duties of the board include, but are not limited to:\n\n(a) Examination of podiatrists;\n\n(b) Development of ethical and other professional standards to be followed by licensees;\n\n(c) Development of continuing professional education requirements and other prerequisites for the renewal or reinstatement of licenses; and\n\n(d) Study and preservation of information concerning the practice of podiatry.\n\nSource. #5391, eff 5-8-92, EXPIRED: 5-8-98\n\nNew. #7816, eff 1-7-03; ss by #14372, eff 9-19-25",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/pod100-500.html"
